---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Elana | Tender of the Soul"><PageHero eyebrow="About Elana" title="I’ll meet you there." intro="A compassionate, body-centered relationship where your experience is honored, your pace matters, and nothing needs to be forced."/>
<section class="section"><div class="container grid-2"><div class="portrait"><span>Practitioner portrait<br><small>Replace through CMS before launch</small></span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">The person beside the process</p><h2>Presence before prescription.</h2><p class="lead">I hold a permission structure that helps people feel what has been too scary to feel. I meet them there and accompany them where they need to go.</p><p>My role is not to tell you where your process should lead. It is to offer attentive, grounded companionship as we listen for what is already asking to be known.</p><p>I work with adults navigating the effects of painful experiences, anxiety, grief, chronic stress, burnout, life transitions, relationship patterns, and the feeling of being stuck or disconnected from themselves.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section soft-panel"><div class="narrow"><p class="eyebrow">My orientation</p><h2>The body is not an obstacle to overcome.</h2><p class="lead">It is often where adaptation, memory, longing, and quiet wisdom have been held.</p><p>With mindfulness and curiosity, we can approach these places without demanding that they change. This creates room for the patterns beneath the surface to become visible, and perhaps to soften.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container credentials"><div><p class="eyebrow">Training & background</p><h2>Practice details</h2><p>Specific credentials are intentionally left as visible placeholders until Elana’s verified training information is supplied.</p></div><dl><div><dt>Hakomi training</dt><dd>[Add verified training, institution, and completion status]</dd></div><div><dt>Trauma training</dt><dd>[Add verified program and completion status]</dd></div><div><dt>Additional modalities</dt><dd>[Add modalities and accurately describe level of training]</dd></div><div><dt>Education & memberships</dt><dd>[Add relevant education and professional memberships]</dd></div><div><dt>Scope of practice</dt><dd>[Add locally reviewed scope-of-practice language]</dd></div></dl></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.portrait{display:grid;min-height:620px;place-items:center;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#cbd3c4,#8fa28d);color:var(--forest);text-align:center;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.5rem}.portrait small{font:600 .65rem var(--sans);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.credentials{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;gap:5rem}.credentials dl{margin:0}.credentials dl div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.55fr 1fr;padding:1.3rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}dt{font-weight:600}dd{margin:0;color:#687872}@media(max-width:760px){.credentials{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.credentials dl div{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.3rem}.portrait{min-height:450px}}</style>
